4231 0 obj
  << /ActualText (housekeeping deletes the media if its not archived\056\015\n4 API\047s are in development\056 fore customers and for CCTV providers\056\015\n\015\n\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\015\nVCH video camera health notes\056\015\nactuate is immix\047s current AI provider filter for alarms\054 VCH uses it\056\015\nthe report for the VCH system can be accessed raw from the database\015\nVCH Outcomes can be set to email support staff on an unhealthy camera\056\015\n\015\nVCH will detect\072\015\nblur\054\015\ntampers\054\015\nglare\054\015\nblank\054\015\noffline\054\015\ngeneral negative system integrity\015\n\015\nautomated response for all of these will show in immix via auto patrols raising\056\015\n\015\n\055 ensures uptime and decreases operational risk\015\n\055 reduces operator workload\015\n\055 easy configuration\015\n\015\nadded to bill\073 1\05650 per camera\057month\056\015\nchecks the camera 4 times  a day\015\ndon\047t stop the camera unless its before the payday\054 otherwise the 1\05650 will be paid for nothing\056\015\n\015\nImmix bills us monthly\056\015\n\015\n\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\015\n\015\nhow in\055depth are Immix\047s new API\047s\054 can i clear all alarms\054 raise a custom alarm\077\015\nsystem overview immix\056\015\n\015\nPowerBI \055 immix offered service\054 just like VCH\015\n\015\nimmix cannot task reports\056\015\n\015\nimmix training videos will be updated\056\015\nImmix only teaches the very basics through their tutorials\056\015\nUsually the customer\015\n\015\nGet back to\072\015\n1\056 API\047s\015\n2\056 AJAX\015\n3\056 Payment terms\015\n)
